+            "Which Beacon API RATHER THAN Sink accepts state?",
+            "Which Beacon API rather\tthan Sink accepts state?",
+            "Which Beacon API rather\nthan Sink accepts state?",
+            "Which Beacon API (rather than) Sink accepts state?",
+            "Which Beacon API rather, than Sink accepts state?",
